{"2721440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hyper Fin", "steam_appid": 2721440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4871220], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper Fin is a <strong>Movement Based Fighting Game</strong> built around <strong>Speed</strong>! Using your drift, dash, and slow time abilities, you'll out-maneuver enemies to Blast yourself into their weak points.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/bc481b81927d8f0f002b1363b9c807d1.poster.avif?t=1786621093\" width=614 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/bc481b81927d8f0f002b1363b9c807d1.webm?t=1786621093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/bc481b81927d8f0f002b1363b9c807d1.mp4?t=1786621093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unique, fast paced movement gameplay that will relentlessly demand instant, gut-feeling shots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a variety of enemies in intense hoards and boss battles. Play enemies off of each other and carefully choose which to prioritize.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bast through an everchanging arena  that takes full advantage of the 3D space. Defeat enemies quickly enough to climb up a mysterious tower! What awaits at the top??</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system is built around speed! Make risky split-second, gut-feeling decisions to improve your place on the leaderboards! Moving quickly influences every aspect of the game from the progression and leaderboards, to even the creature collection.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of different creatures and skins as you fill out your collection and show off on the high score boards! Collectable spawn rates are influenced by your performance, so you'll be rewarded for each part of the game you master. If you're lucky you may even encounter shinnies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.poster.avif?t=1786621093\" width=614 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.webm?t=1786621093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.mp4?t=1786621093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Speed Precision!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/c33ffea35977a3b4544d33fd6b3dc19d.poster.avif?t=1786621093\" width=614 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/c33ffea35977a3b4544d33fd6b3dc19d.webm?t=1786621093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/c33ffea35977a3b4544d33fd6b3dc19d.mp4?t=1786621093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collection!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it